# cabin_rain: the rain's curtain over the whole plate (BUILD_PLAN S7, 5.8):
# streaks one pixel wide and six tall in glacier blue, slanting a pixel left
# every three rows, denser over the trees and the cabin and densest over
# the lit windows, sparse on the sky and the lower lawn, about 3% of the
# plate. At night they go navy, so they cross the lit windows as dark
# lines. On the near layer, at the plate's origin.
